## Prototype (in front of the backend)

This branch ships a working prototype under \`.beacon/prototype/\` — the repo's
real components rendered on mock data, instead of touching the backend.

- \`.beacon/prototype/README.md\` — added
- \`.beacon/prototype/fixtures.json\` — added

**Backend work needed to make it real:**

- Needs \`GET /api/prices\` returning \`{ id, amount }[]\`
- FIXME: currency comes from account settings

## Why this approach

- Reuses existing components: \`Card\`, \`Badge\`, \`Stack\`
- Reuses design tokens / variables: \`@acme/tokens\`, \`../design-tokens/space\`, \`--brand-primary\`, \`--space-4\`, \`tokens.color.primary\`

